# Version control the CODE only (config.R, README.md, and scripts in
# analysis/, figures/, tables/, packages/). Inputs and generated outputs stay out:
#   data/    inputs (Zenodo) + large GLORYS/GEBCO grids
#   output/  intermediate .RData generated along the pipeline
#   results/ final figures & tables (each script's own subfolder)
# NOTE: .gitignore has no trailing comments -- patterns must stand alone.

data/*
output/*
results/*
!**/.gitkeep

.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj
